config PROFILE_ARM
    prompt "Target profile"
    type choice
    var ROSCONFIG_PROFILE
    value generic "Generic ARMv7"
    value profile_raspberry2 "Raspberry Pi 2"
    value profile_raspberry3 "Raspberry Pi 3 (32-bit)"
    default generic
    depends ARCH=arm
    help
      Generic builds the ARMv7-A target without board-specific packages.

      Raspberry Pi 2 and Raspberry Pi 3 (32-bit) start the SD host and the
      DWC2 USB controller of the board as boot drivers, bound to the nodes of
      its device tree, and include the SMSC95xx Ethernet driver. The board
      boots through U-Boot's UEFI.
